  "description": {
   "en": "Leticia, the duke's daughter nicknamed \"the Beautiful Doll,\" possesses a delicate appearance. However, her true nature combines courage and compassion, making her an exceptional person. She is arranged to be engaged to the second prince, Gilbert, who is rumored to have a difficult and improper character. A flawless and perfect duke's daughter and a lonely, clumsy prince cursed with red eyes.",
   "ja": "『美しい人形（ベル・プペー）』のあだ名を持つ、公爵令嬢レティシア。儚げな容姿とは裏腹に、その本性は包容力と豪胆さを兼ね備えた屈指のスパダリであった。そんな彼女が、素行に難ありと噂される第二皇子ジルベールと婚約することになり――。無謬のスパダリ令嬢と、孤独で不器用な呪われし赤目の皇子。"
  },
